    strs_push(l, "tier 2; no survivor, nothing unusable or unapplied, no timeout; the workspace suite never")
    strs_push(l, "ran. **One MUTANT CRASH, `nesting-unbounded`**, the known open entry above, as it was: with")
    strs_push(l, "the nesting limit removed the parse stack overflows, as it did at N13 and N14. N15 did not")
