    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "*N32 (2026-09-29) added seventeen, and N32-H two for the harness,* on the frozen final source;")
    strs_push(l, "one N27 entry was re-pointed at the line its rule moved to. The seventeen attack N32's laws: an")
    strs_push(l, "anchor ignored, a line number as an id, a duplicate id accepted, an unknown id answered with the")
    strs_push(l, "nearest, fences never opened, a parent carrying its children, the goals classified as evidence")
    strs_push(l, "and the roadmap as normative, a production's text normalised, a broken link ignored, a corpus")
    strs_push(l, "state without the text or with the checkout's absolute path, a section digest without the body,")
    strs_push(l, "a stale state answered, the MCP section tool taking any argument, sending a section twice, or")
    strs_push(l, "keeping the first. The two guard the warm session: a killer that passed on its mutant counted")
    strs_push(l, "verified, and a live supervisor's container reaped. **One warm session, campaign")
    strs_push(l, "`81c571e1e7d95767`, targeted, P1, 1,469 s:** those nineteen and the twelve MCP entries of")
    strs_push(l, "N27–N31 in the server N32 extended — **31 of 31 caught at tier 1**; no survivor, crash, timeout,")
