    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "*N32-H3 (2026-09-29) added seven harness mutations,* on the frozen final source: a failing binary")
    strs_push(l, "cancelling the rest, results in completion order, the shortest binary first, execution ignoring")
    strs_push(l, "the owning package, an unknown path bringing no benchmark, the whole lifecycle suite not")
    strs_push(l, "covering its tests, and a package id losing its name. **One warm session, campaign")
    strs_push(l, "`f4f5c0b996691ef4`, targeted, P1, 833 s:** those seven, N32's seventeen, the twelve MCP entries and")
    strs_push(l, "the nine earlier harness entries — **45 of 45 caught at tier 1**, no survivor, crash, timeout,")
    strs_push(l, "unusable or uninjected entry, no runner error — and **every declared killer verified, 48 of 48**.")
    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "The run also found three harness defects, all repaired before the counted run:")
    strs_push(l, "`memory.rs` ran compiled programs with no deadline (the loop mutant waited 1500 s for a")
    strs_push(l, "verdict it could not get); N12.1's process-group kills used `kill -KILL -<pgid>`, which")
