    strs_push(l, "### N31 — Token-efficient build and test output v1 — **complete, 2026-09-28**")
    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "The first executable step toward G76. `--summary-json` on `nazm check` and `nazm build` prints one")
    strs_push(l, "`nazm.command-summary/1`: the command's own status — one per exit path — and exit status, and a")
    strs_push(l, "reference to every diagnostic it reported, with N30's id where N30 indexes it and an explicit")
    strs_push(l, "command reference where it does not (a missing `main`, a backend's refusal). On `nazm test` it")
    strs_push(l, "prints one `nazm.test-summary/1`: counts from each case's verdict, and only the cases that did not")
    strs_push(l, "pass, with how each leg ended, read from what the runner did. Summary is an additive view, not a")
    strs_push(l, "replacement for existing detailed machine output, and absence of diagnostics does not imply")
    strs_push(l, "command success. `nazm-mcp` adds `nazm.command_summary` for `check` only — building and testing are")
    strs_push(l, "not read-only. Human output, `--json`, `nazm.test/1`, `nazm.check-report/1`, `nazm.build-report/1`,")
    strs_push(l, "every exit status and every existing schema are unchanged: `SEMANTIC_EPOCH` 7, `nazm.interface/5`;")
    strs_push(l, "two new machine schemas.")
    strs_push(l, "")
