    strs_push(l, "### N30 — Compact machine diagnostics and progressive disclosure v1 — **complete, 2026-09-28**")
    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "The first executable step toward G74, G75 and G77. `nazm.diagnostic-index/1` is every current")
    strs_push(l, "diagnostic of a root compilation as compiler-owned facts — id, code, severity, file and byte range,")
    strs_push(l, "owning definition, fix counts — with no prose; `nazm.diagnostic-detail/1` is one of them in full on")
    strs_push(l, "request, the diagnostic exactly as `nazm.diagnostic/1` publishes it, with its places in their files")
    strs_push(l, "and, for each fix, the N29 selector where a semantic patch is plannable. Compact diagnostics never")
    strs_push(l, "infer structured semantics from diagnostic prose, and a compiler fix and an N29 semantic patch are")
    strs_push(l, "distinct capabilities. Syntax diagnostics are indexed, bound to a digest of the loaded sources where")
    strs_push(l, "N28 has no snapshot. `nazm diagnostics` prints both; `nazm-mcp` adds `nazm.diagnostics` and")
    strs_push(l, "`nazm.diagnostic_detail`. `nazm.diagnostic/1`, `nazm check --json`, the language server and every")
    strs_push(l, "existing schema are unchanged: `SEMANTIC_EPOCH` 7, `nazm.interface/5`; two new machine schemas.")
    strs_push(l, "")
