    strs_push(l, "### N29 — Minimal semantic patch plan v1 — **complete, 2026-09-27**")
    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "The first executable step toward G72. `nazm.patch/1` is an edit the compiler already validates —")
    strs_push(l, "N18's rename, or the fix a current diagnostic carries (N24) — as minimal exact-byte edits, bound")
    strs_push(l, "to the root's N28 snapshot digest, each edited file's BLAKE3 digest and each edit's expected")
    strs_push(l, "bytes. N29 plans edits but never applies them: a patch is a proposal bound to exact semantic and")
    strs_push(l, "source state, not permission to mutate files. Exported rename remains refused, because one root")
    strs_push(l, "compilation is not a complete importer universe; the language server's closed-file rule is")
    strs_push(l, "unchanged. `nazm patch rename|fix` prints a plan; `nazm-mcp` adds one read-only planning tool,")
    strs_push(l, "`nazm.semantic_patch`, and keeps no plan. No language, interface, cache-key or bootstrap change:")
    strs_push(l, "`SEMANTIC_EPOCH` 7, `nazm.interface/5`, `nazm.context/1`, `nazm.snapshot/1`, `nazm.delta/1`")
    strs_push(l, "unchanged; one new machine schema.")
