    strs_push(l, "### N28 — Semantic snapshot manifest and semantic delta v1 — **complete, 2026-09-27**")
    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "The first executable step toward G71. `nazm.snapshot/1` is one root compilation's durable")
    strs_push(l, "functions, records and enums, by `DefKey` alone, each with one BLAKE3 digest per section the")
    strs_push(l, "compiler records — exact source, shape, dependencies, related types, references, callers, callees,")
    strs_push(l, "diagnostics — taken over identities and counts, never offsets or session ids. `nazm.delta/1`")
    strs_push(l, "compares a baseline snapshot, validated strictly as data, with the current compilation: added,")
    strs_push(l, "removed, and changed with exactly which sections changed. A rename is removed plus added; a comment")
    strs_push(l, "or a literal is `source` alone. N28 reports changes in the semantic surfaces Nazm currently records;")
    strs_push(l, "it is not a proof of behavioural equivalence, and effects, capabilities, tests, history and")
    strs_push(l, "behavioural equivalence are unsupported, not unchanged. `nazm snapshot` and `nazm delta` print")
    strs_push(l, "them; `nazm-mcp` adds two read-only tools and keeps no snapshot — the client keeps its baseline. No")
    strs_push(l, "language, interface, cache-key or bootstrap change: `SEMANTIC_EPOCH` 7, `nazm.interface/5`,")
    strs_push(l, "`nazm.context/1` unchanged; two new machine schemas.")
