    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "### N25 — Semantic call hierarchy: prepare, incoming and outgoing calls — **complete, 2026-09-26**")
    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "An editor can now ask which source functions call a function and which it calls, one level at a")
    strs_push(l, "time. An item is a function the checker declared from source, prepared from its declaration or")
    strs_push(l, "a call through the reference index, at its outline symbol's ranges; an edge is a checked call to")
    strs_push(l, "such a function, attributed to the body the checker recorded it in, grouped by the function at")
    strs_push(l, "the other end with every callee name. No per-call state, no graph and no item table: each answer")
    strs_push(l, "is derived from the current analysis and dropped. An item is bound to the compilation it was")
    strs_push(l, "prepared in and the generation it was prepared at, and is unanswered after any change or once")
    strs_push(l, "its root closes. It is complete only for that compilation snapshot — not every caller in a")
    strs_push(l, "project — so exported rename stays refused. No language, interface, schema, cache-key or")
    strs_push(l, "bootstrap change: `SEMANTIC_EPOCH` 7, `nazm.interface/5`, fixpoint `0e1a40e6…`.")
    strs_push(l, "")
    strs_push(l, "| Settled | Where |")
    strs_push(l, "| --- | --- |")
    strs_push(l, "| `prepare_call_hierarchy`, `incoming_calls`, `outgoing_calls`, `Locator`; `function_symbol` shared with the outline | `crates/nazm-service/src/hierarchy.rs`, `crates/nazm-service/src/symbols.rs`, `architecture.md` §7.27 |")
    strs_push(l, "| `textDocument/prepareCallHierarchy` and `callHierarchy/incomingCalls` / `outgoingCalls`, UTF-16, stale item `null` | `crates/nazm-cli/src/lsp.rs` |")
    strs_push(l, "| what it costs: no detected analyse/edit/RSS delta; no persistent state; incoming over the compiler about 0.5 ms; +65,536 bytes of binary | `performance.md` |")
